pn();
pn("\"I came to give you some presents; a basket and a pot of butter,\" specified Red Riding Hood.");
pn();
pn("\"How much time are you planning to spend here?\"");
pn();
pn("\"A couple of hours,\" answered Red Riding Hood after pondering for a few seconds.");
pn();
pn("\"Why are your answers so uncertain?\"");
pn();
pn("\"Two hours,\" the girl quickly blurted out.");
pn();
pn("\"Wow, how quickly you responded!\"");
pn();
pn("\"Spent much time on planning your answers and memorizing them, did you?\"");
pn();
pn("Red Riding Hood didn\'t know what to answer, so after a few seconds she said: \"I\'m your granddaughter Red Riding Hood. I came to see you and brought some gifts.\"");
pn();
pn("\"What\'s in the basket?\" suspiciously asked the hag.");
pn();
pn("\"Pastries,\" wearily answered Red Riding Hood.");
pn();
pn("\"What type of filling?\"");
pn();
pn("\"Cottage cheese.\"");
pn();
pn("\"How many?\"");
pn();
pn("Red Riding Hood started counting.");
pn();
pn("\"Don\'t you know how many pastries you\'re carrying?\" said the hag with suspicion.");
pn();
pn("The hag\'s last words made Red Riding Hood lose count and she started counting anew.");
