    dsc = function(s)
pn("Granny was walking along the path, when suddenly, Wolf appeared on the trail.");
pn();
pn("\"Hello! What is your name and where are you going?\" asked Wolf.");
pn();
pn("\"I\'m Granny, going to see my relatives,\" replied the old lady, who couldn\'t see well without her glasses and thought she was talking to a short, hairy man.");
pn();
pn("\"And I\'m Wolf.\"");
pn();
pn("\"What an interesting name you have,\" said the hag trying to seem polite, because in her opinion this man was a potential fiancé for her daughter.");
pn();
pn("\"Where do your relatives live?\" asked Wolf.");
pn();
pn("At that moment Granny\'s hearing aid malfunctioned and she thought Wolf had said \'eat\' instead of \'live\'.");
pn();
pn("\"Where, hmm? In their home,\" replied the old lady who was a little surprised to hear such a strange question.");
pn();
pn("\"Where is their home?\" asked Wolf like among other things.");
pn();
pn("Once again because of the problems with her hearing aid the hag heard: \"Where is the groom?\"");
pn();
pn("The hag pondered for a few seconds and afterwards replied:");
pn();
pn("\"My daughter has no groom yet. Do you have a girlfriend?\"");
pn();
pn("Wolf looked at the hag with astonishment and for some reason replied: \"Yes.\"");
pn();
pn("\"Too bad!\" The hag let out a sigh. \"I mean congrats, have a nice day.\" The old lady was no longer interested in the interlocutor, so she straightened her hat and sallied forth.");
pn();
pn(" Wolf was standing on the trail, following the old woman with his eyes. He couldn\'t get proper information from her, but he had a better idea to follow the old lady who was going to the house full of relatives.");
pn();
pn("");
pn();
