pn("\"How was your travel here?\"");
pn();
pn("\"Not without incidents this time,\" replied Mother and began her story in detail of how she was preparing for the trip and how cold it was in the forest; how she met Wolf first and the woodcutter later.");
pn();
pn(" After finishing her monologue, Mother asked the old woman about her health. The old lady gave a thorough reply.");
pn();
pn(" Plus the health story was mixed with personal memories. Who knows how long the old woman\'s story would have taken, if not for the unpleasant aroma Mother now smelled.");
pn();
pn("");
pn();
pn("\'\'I think something got burnt,\" Mother said thoughtfully and immediately exclaimed. \"Oh, my God! The pastries!\"");
pn();
pn("She rushed to the oven. But when she opened the oven door, she got a coughing fit because of the thick, grey smoke pouring out and filling the room.");
pn();
pn("\"What? Are all the pastries gone?\" asked the old lady with a sad voice.");
pn();
pn("\"Yes,\" simply answered Mother.");
pn();
