    dsc = function(s)
pn("Mother decided to not waste time on an additional cover. The woman just took her treats and left. It turned out to be much colder outside than she expected.");
pn();
pn(" After walking halfway, Mother felt very cold. Suddenly she noticed a light not far from her. When she came closer, she saw there was a woodcutter sitting by a fire.");
pn();
pn("");
pn();
pn("\"Hello, sir. May I warm up a little by the fire,\" said Mother.");
pn();
pn("\"Good day, madam. Please, sit on the log with me.\"");
pn();
pn("When she made herself comfortable near the woodcutter, Mother felt pleasant warmth coming from the fire.");
pn();
pn("\"Allow me to treat you to a pastry as a token of my gratitude,\" Mother said, putting her hand inside the basket.");
pn();
pn("\"Thanks, I\'d be glad to try one,\" replied the woodcutter. When the man got his pastry, he warmed it up by poking a short branch into it and holding it above the fire and once the pastry was heated, started eating.");
pn();
pn(" The pastry was delicious and the woodcutter asked what Mother\'s name was and where she was going. While the woman was talking about herself and the reason for her travel, the woodcutter was furtively looking at her, but he could see only her eyes, because the lower part of her face was covered by a scarf.");
pn();
pn(" But her eyes were beautiful and her voice was quite pleasant.");
pn();
pn("");
