pn("\"He\'s trying to lull my vigilance. Maybe he\'s a robber? I have to stay sharp,\" thought Mother.");
pn();
pn("\"Of course I can!\" suddenly blurted out the woman as she wound up and threw a frozen pastry right at the man\'s nose. Afterwards, as usual, she quickly ran away.");
