pn("Wolf ran away without listening to the end of the conversation. And the woodcutter, seeing that Mother was about to leave, suggested:");
pn();
pn("\"Let\'s meet in the evening by the house on the forest edge and I will accompany you back home.\"");
pn();
pn("\"OK, I\'ll be waiting for you,\" Mother agreed and left. After this, the woodcutter started working with enthusiasm.");
pn();
pn(" He was cutting trees down with zeal, when he soon noticed that his daily work was done. So he decided to call it a day.");
pn();
pn(" He buttoned up his coat, put out the fire and went towards the forest edge. It was getting dark, and it became even colder in the forest. The woodcutter began to ponder, whether he should drink a little to warm himself up.");
pn();
