pn("Ten years have passed. Red Riding Hood was still living in the forest with her mother. One day, she went to the forest to pick some berries and met a wolf.");
pn();
pn(" For a few seconds they silently looked at each other. The wolf was the first one to break the silence. After looking at the girl\'s hat, he asked:");
pn();
pn("");
pn();
pn("\"Are you Red Riding Hood?\"");
pn();
pn("\"Yes,\" the girl replied.");
pn();
pn("\"Finally, I\'ve found you,\" sighed the wolf with relief.");
pn();
pn("\"How do you know me?\" Red Riding Hood was surprised. \"Are you one of the wolf cubs I once treated to my mother\'s pastries?\"");
pn();
pn("The wolf began to blink with astonishment, trying to figure out what Red Riding Hood meant. Finally, he replied:");
pn();
pn("\"No. I\'m one of the grandsons of the wolf you were sliding down the ice hill with once. He became old.");
pn();
pn(" And he asked us to help him with some wishes. We couldn\'t refuse and completed them all, except for the major one.");
pn();
pn(" He mentioned your name, so we can\'t do it without you. Can you come with me and help out on this one?\"");
pn();
pn("");
pn();
pn("The wolf looked intently at Red Riding Hood. The girl clearly could see a need for her help in the matter.");
pn();
pn(" She thought for a moment. Red Riding Hood recollected the happy moments she had on the ice hill with Wolf. Without hesitating any longer she agreed.");
pn();
pn("");
pn();
    end,
